include README.md LICENSE CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md CHANGELOG.md pyproject.toml uv.lock
recursive-include src/inkform *.py *.json
recursive-include skills/inkform *.md *.py *.yaml
recursive-include examples *.json
